<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:20:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>风险不断加大，哥伦比亚比索面临考验反弹的风险</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/colombia-peso-stumbles-as-mounting-risks-test-carry-fueled-rally</link><description>哥伦比亚比索正面临四年多来最糟糕的一个月，国内外的麻烦混合在一起，削弱了今年最具弹性的货币之一的光芒。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/colombia-peso-stumbles-as-mounting-risks-test-carry-fueled-rally'&gt;风险不断加大，哥伦比亚比索面临考验反弹的风险&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Colombia Peso Stumbles as Mounting Risks Test Rally&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/colombia-peso-stumbles-as-mounting-risks-test-carry-fueled-rally</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:37:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</link><description>中国国务院在罕见的午间会议上重申了对资本市场的支持，强调了所谓国家队的作用，并承诺推出更多稳定股市的政策。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release'&gt;中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Spurs Biggest Stock Gain Since 2024 on Rare Midday Vow&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：S&amp;P 500 Has Best Week Since April 2025 on AI Rally: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>墨西哥机场运营商 GAP 为 Fibra Trust 融资 3.98 亿美元</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mexican-airport-operator-gap-raises-398-million-for-fibra-trust</link><description>墨西哥机场运营商 Grupo Aeroportuario del Pacifico SAB de CV 为能源和基础设施信托基金筹集了 78 亿比索（3.98 亿美元），低于原计划，并且经历了数月的延误。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mexican-airport-operator-gap-raises-398-million-for-fibra-trust'&gt;墨西哥机场运营商 GAP 为 Fibra Trust 融资 3.98 亿美元&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mexican Airport Operator GAP Raises $398 Million for Fibra Trust&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mexican-airport-operator-gap-raises-398-million-for-fibra-trust</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:05:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil’s Real Caps Best Week Since 2020 as Trabuco Lifts Mood&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>